#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1901
msgid "Reset Sync State?"
msgstr "¿Restablecer el estado de sincronización?"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1903
msgid ""
"The next sync will treat THIS machine's local hosts/settings/quickies as authoritative and push them into the current sync folder, instead of merging based on history.\n"
"\n"
"Only do this after pointing Sync at a new or empty folder you want to seed — not because a normal sync failed."
msgstr ""
"La próxima sincronización tratará los hosts/ajustes/rapiditos locales de ESTE equipo como autoritativos y los subirá a la carpeta de sincronización actual, en lugar de fusionarlos según el historial.\n"
"\n"
"Haz esto solo tras apuntar la sincronización a una carpeta nueva o vacía que quieras inicializar — no porque haya fallado una sincronización normal."

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1910
msgid "Reset and Sync Now"
msgstr "Restablecer y sincronizar ahora"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1959
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sync now (last: {time})"
msgstr "Sincronizar ahora (última: {time})"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1961
msgid "Sync paused — archive identity needs confirmation"
msgstr "Sincronización en pausa — es necesario confirmar la identidad del archivo"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:1965
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sync failed: {error}"
msgstr "Falló la sincronización: {error}"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2004
msgid "Create a New Sync Archive?"
msgstr "¿Crear un nuevo archivo de sincronización?"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2006
msgid ""
"No existing sync archive was found at this folder — neither this machine nor the folder itself has one yet.\n"
"\n"
"If this is genuinely a new or empty folder, continuing is safe: it seeds the archive from this machine's current hosts/settings. But if this folder is supposed to already have an archive (e.g. a cloud-synced folder that just hasn't finished downloading yet), continuing now would create a SEPARATE, competing archive instead of joining the real one — wait and try again instead."
msgstr ""

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2016
msgid "Create and Sync Now"
msgstr "Crear y sincronizar ahora"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2029
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "desconocido"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2032
msgid "Connect to a Different Sync Archive?"
msgstr "¿Conectar con un archivo de sincronización distinto?"

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2034
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The sync folder now contains a different archive than the one this machine last used (id {sync_id}, last synced {when}, {hosts} hosts, {quickies} Quickies).\n"
"\n"
"This can happen on purpose (a new shared folder, a teammate's archive) or by mistake (the wrong folder was chosen). Continuing merges this machine's local hosts/settings into it — nothing is deleted on either side, but from then on this machine treats that archive as the one it syncs with."
msgstr ""

#: thongssh_gtk/window.py:2046
msgid "Connect and Sync Now"
msgstr "Conectar y sincronizar ahora"

